                                                <th style="width: 10%; border: 3px solid black; font-size:13px; padding:2px;"><strong>Тоо</strong></th>
                                                <th style=" width: 20%; border: 3px solid black; font-size:13px; padding:2px;" class="text-right"><strong>Хүлээлгэн өгсөн</strong></th>
